[{"title":"文昌殿落成","author":"顾建元","text":"青云有路桂森森，只是难教俗土寻。\n一部化书君记取，殿头风雨又秋深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32080,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒梅里泰伯庙","author":"顾建元","text":"封豕长蛇恐不堪，天生神圣此幽探。\n乾坤欲辟湖山秀，草木应滋雨露甘。\n伯仲偕来心共白，商周已往事谁谙。\n村翁牧竖无知识，也说宣尼表让三。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32081,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"慧川园诗 其一","author":"顾建元","text":"虽有千尺水，不洗三丈尘。\n我有洗尘诀，寂坐掩园门。\n门中何所有，物物皆乾坤。\n心中何所事，默默见形神。\n昨夜有客至，举头檐月新。\n清风亦俱来，邈然与古邻。\n安知古何似，且作园中人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32082,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠蔡斯篁","author":"顾维钫","text":"一片青山倚剑天，往时曾此梦凌烟。\n白头似雪休看镜，明月如弓又上弦。\n虎项班超飞食肉，雁书苏武卧吞膻。\n闻君梅里成归计，为我前滩唤钓船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32083,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"挽鄂刚烈公","author":"顾维钫","text":"将相家风济代才，鄂公秉节旧登台。\n他年士庶悲羊祜，今日朝廷忆郭隗。\n瀚海阴风新鬼哭，沙场碧血异花开。\n昭忠祠庙英灵聚，为报高堂辫发回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32084,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠鹤","author":"顾忠","text":"碧落茫茫路本宽，稻粱虽好岂怀安。\n逡巡池馆梳翎意，浩荡云霄侧眼看。\n警露无声常阒寂，附书有约肯盘桓。\n怪他斥鴳枪枋上，翻笑飞鸣九万抟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32085,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石门柬杨东表","author":"顾忠","text":"恨不携君续旧游，为君先路觅丹邱。\n未知门待何时启，须信仙非有意求。\n触石层云疑太古，薄人岚气总深秋。\n炎肠热症能消骨，一剂清凉到此投。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32086,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"积书岩下小憩三首 其一","author":"顾乾","text":"积德百年兴礼乐，积书万卷拜蒸尝。\n我来半日苍岩下，山鸟衔花当瓣香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32087,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"积书岩下小憩三首 其二","author":"顾乾","text":"金莲池水起微波，士女年年桥上过。\n记得鲈塘秋雨歇，看人来往数青蓑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32088,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"积书岩下小憩三首 其三","author":"顾乾","text":"岩石苔封蝌蚪文，秦皇坞外未曾焚。\n若教世世常能读，何处青山不出云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32089,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日同人惠山登高归舟游作","author":"顾乾","text":"四时佳景重阳最，千古登临我辈同。\n缥缈长绳难系日，飕飗破帽不禁风。\n羞从白首过吟社，满载黄花上钓篷。\n新茗烹来雨前绿，萧萧两岸醉丹枫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32090,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桃花岭用陈卧子先生韵","author":"顾鸿","text":"百折桃花峡，迢峣势逼天。\n乱山青叠浪，远树绿沉烟。\n叱驭疑无地，当垆别有廛。\n乔松一再抚，霄汉日常悬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32091,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游石门","author":"顾鸿","text":"古人渺何处，逸响超凡群。\n徙倚十尺堂，望古怀清芬。\n嶙峋具仙骨，薜荔呈元文。\n幽禽乐涧阿，嘤嘤天际闻。\n风吹洞口香，萧寥疑是君。\n名士喜名山，岂以今昔分。\n朅来金阊道，枫暗吴江濆。\n所愿既获偿，歌阕看些曛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32092,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泾皋十咏 其一 先陇松屏","author":"顾书绅","text":"峥嵘气象旧幽宫，冈陇回环老树中。\n隔岸松屏更奇谷，晚寒苍翠夕阳红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32093,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泾皋十咏 其二 宗祠双桂","author":"顾书绅","text":"百年遗泽宛如新，庭桂双株冠等伦。\n风送异香闻十里，石栏珍重奉清尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32094,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泾皋十咏 其三 小心斋","author":"顾书绅","text":"执中授受式如金，申命人心与道心。\n择得名言更亲切，兢兢慄慄凛渊深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32095,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泾皋十咏 其四 小辫斋","author":"顾书绅","text":"学术纷纭似猬毛，是非真伪析秋毫。\n伟哉孟氏承三圣，小辫詹詹敢惮劳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32096,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泾皋十咏 其五 寄藤","author":"顾书绅","text":"弱蔓柔条野色新，托根老桧几秋春。\n花开烂漫垂如锦，招得村村拾翠人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32097,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泾皋十咏 其六 蟠槐","author":"顾书绅","text":"古槐蟠踞似龙骄，屈曲离奇绿意饶。\n旅客何须问前路，浓阴斜荫义庄桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32098,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泾皋十咏 其七 魁星阁","author":"顾书绅","text":"丹黄高阁谨门扃，上是文魁下照星。\n知否传家有衣钵，籯金不胜一遗经。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32099,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泾皋十咏 其八 渔步湾","author":"顾书绅","text":"溪行曲曲似桃源，石堰横波水涨痕。\n问到前津渔步渡，从知好景杏花村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32100,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泾皋十咏 其九 义庄碑","author":"顾书绅","text":"旧碑苔蚀卧荒园，半委泥涂半仅存。\n尚义风流敢云泯，复庄千亩试重论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32101,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泾皋十咏 其十 澄江水","author":"顾书绅","text":"路经百里入山隈，几度江潮到地来。\n知是巍科有佳兆，源头活水若为催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32102,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登竹山","author":"顾书绅","text":"行到山穷处，山穷兴未穷。\n路经溪涧远，桥转石岩通。\n天趣登临外，湖光览望中。\n先贤纪游迹，到此一心同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32103,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东宅","author":"顾豫","text":"短短溪桥波一曲，野外风光静如沐。\n人家半住竹林中，风起家家闻戛玉。\n随意看花村复村，村前小坐石床温。\n林深恐失来时路，木杪遥山记一痕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32104,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"贯华阁","author":"顾豫","text":"古院隐檀乐，山门曲径盘。\n推窗宜小憩，就饭强加餐。\n病鹤同僧瘦，梅花与客寒。\n风泉鸣野壑，仿佛玉琴弹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32105,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南禅寺","author":"顾豫","text":"夕阳来古寺，秋满梵王宫。\n塔影澹横水，钟声寒在空。\n扫云僧借榻，飞月鹤开笼。\n小话出门去，前村灯火红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32106,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梅里谒至德祠","author":"顾熙","text":"戎马奔未宁，何暇剪商祀。\n岂无传季心，早于无形视。\n挈弟来勾吴，端委治周礼。\n宁不惜故国，社稷有人在。\n君臣父子间，隐德谁堪拟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32107,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登龙光塔","author":"顾熙","text":"嵯峨望弥上，面削午影圆。\n四角撑晴空，绝蹬凝青烟。\n有时吐光怪，飞鸟不敢前。\n摄衣上层梯，足底云雾穿。\n绝顶一以眺，吴会正茫然。\n五湖烟景阔，诸山何连绵。\n白云滃然来，荡胸洗尘缘。\n铃声乱鸟语，松涛惊鹤眠。\n清景难尽摩，飘飘欲登仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32108,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石门","author":"顾熙","text":"龙山何郁盘，蕴秀在深谷。\n石门阖何年，千古秘仙躅。\n兴到来寻幽，登临仗筇竹。\n徘徊绝蹬闲，竦然骇心目。\n伊阙隐苔青，龙门挂藤绿。\n旁侧涧环流，几尺泻飞瀑。\n更听涛声来，参天荫乔木。\n憩息淡忘归，悠悠寡所欲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32109,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石床","author":"顾熙","text":"苍枝交荫苔藓痕，此床可卧无寒温。\n石寿如松松似石，梦中白日登天门。\n却被清风吹梦醒，仰睹虬龙俯而听。\n汹涌松涛万壑迥，萧然天籁非钟磬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32110,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蠡湖怀古","author":"顾熙","text":"我闻当年范少伯，兴越废吴建奇策。\n功成不屑像范金，抽身竟作烟波客。\n至今踪迹尚流传，十里蠡湖连笠泽。\n我来湖上一徘徊，无限悲怀触绪来。\n古来多少功名士，烹狗藏弓良可哀。\n蠡也超然见几作，轻舟荡漾胸襟开。\n越王旧殿今何在，带水盈盈名不改。\n何缘但说陶朱公，不将此意传千载。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32111,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落梅","author":"顾朝泰","text":"何人夜吹笛，香雪落纷纷。\n流水失残梦，空山欲断云。\n横斜愁对影，迟暮却怜君。\n翠羽啁啾处，疑来月下闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32112,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"环溪桥玩月","author":"顾朝泰","text":"曲水微波动，环桥到影浮。\n美人惜遥夜，明月正当头。\n雨过城根暗，凉生树杪秋。\n葛衣禁露冷，吟啸任迟留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32113,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜过东林精舍","author":"顾朝泰","text":"微步揽夜色，悠悠闻木鱼。\n叩门乞新茗，清绝趣有余。\n明月岂爱我，先我来精庐。\n松风响更寂，竹露滴复徐。\n深谈月华转，坐听三更初。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32114,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小孤山夜半远眺寄双溪兄","author":"顾斗光","text":"少睡宜眠晚，停舟眺夜阑。\n鸡鸣彭泽县，月照小孤山。\n浩渺云林外，飘摇风水间。\n遥知冰署内，坐话客途艰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32115,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忍草庵访杨筼谷及侄颖伯","author":"顾斗光","text":"突兀千崖上，欹斜一径寒。\n水声喧脚底，山色涌眉端。\n此地不来久，故人相见欢。\n探幽还未遍，那得坐盘桓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32116,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"坐寄畅园听杨令贻吹箫","author":"顾斗光","text":"万木森初夏，清阴昭令颜。\n水从山曲折，人与石潺湲。\n细雨不时洒，斜阳一角殷。\n不知谁是客，赤壁荡舟还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32117,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南柯子","author":"顾斗光","text":"雨拭遥山碧，云连夕照黄。\n新秋多少好风光。\n未免有情难遣，是离肠。\n信隔红墙远，愁怜独夜长。\n终朝相看只寻常。\n不道个人去后，便凄凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32118,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"临江仙 枯坐萧然浑似醉","author":"顾斗光","text":"枯坐萧然浑似醉，夜深犹剔孤檠。\n卷帘时见渡河星。\n绿杨风少力，红藕露含情。\n窗外琤纵敲响竹，草间萤火纵横。\n蝶飞不到梦难成。\n寺钟愁断续，邻笛听分明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32119,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赛神会","author":"顾敩愉","text":"丝竹声满堂，木偶不解欢。\n锦绣衣满身，木偶不解寒。\n宝殿连云起，金碧高屼巉。\n日暮赛神会，井邑何喧阗。\n前驱盛珍丽，游人夹道观。\n摐金伐大鼓，络绎出庙门。\n霓旌何摇曳，芝盖如飘云。\n对对鹊尾炉，兽炭香氤氲。\n四角垂璎珞，珍珠一一穿。\n团圞雀羽扇，婀娜风子幡。\n鼓吹相追随，清音激云端。\n市中簇仗齐，寂静无敢喧。\n黄纸斜封敕，马上七宝鞍。\n稳畀沉香舆，庙貌何魏然。\n日近继以烛，华灯尚蝉联。\n翡翠琉璃盏，落索垂青莲。\n但夸嚣物丽，遑计财帛艰。\n入庙更排班，庙令自言尊。\n何以犒执事，请彻堂上筵。\n何以肥囊橐，请捐里巷钱。\n牲牷何腯肥，庙令恣饱餐。\n上述岂有知，感此为长叹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32120,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮登龙山游石浪庵月出始归","author":"顾敩愉","text":"古树生浓阴，四顾山色暝。\n清溪罗众岫，苍翠无定影。\n牵衣避榛林，直到无人境。\n置身崔巍间，远目已可逞。\n下俯若颓浪，上刺如脱颖。\n幽谷魑魅潜，古洞龙螭猛。\n闲行入山寺，更喜俗事屏。\n梵声出高寒，禅心惬闲情。\n胡麻满地种，散漫无畦町。\n陆离三株树，的皪九光杏。\n清露濯琼枝，明霞荫金鼎。\n既滋兰九畹，又树蕙百顷。\n惝恍灵踪远，豁达尘梦醒。\n独怜此中趣，尽属幽僧领。\n携尊时命酒，试水或啜茗。\n攀援尚未毕，所恃秋日永。\n须臾光景暮，系之愿长绠。\n寻幽意忘倦，来处不复省。\n徐看返照灭，新蟾散清景。\n一径入杉萝，遍地纷藻荇。\n泉鸣孤涧底，鹊语万松顶。\n阴火夜潋滟，雾淞秋晦冥。\n坛虚彩虬跃，霜下素鹤警。\n同游指前峰，观止不敢请。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32121,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夕泛蓉湖","author":"顾敩愉","text":"向晚乘清兴，归桡傍水濆。\n波澄千岫翠，鸳梦半溪云。\n暮霭烟中暝，残钟花外闻。\n偶停青雀舫，来访白鸥群。\n芳渚多幽趣，虚襟扫俗氛。\n碧潭摩树影，明镜净霞文。\n载酒过前浦，吟诗对夕曛。\n舸还萍叶静，棹转水光分。\n冷露菰将绿，微风兰芷芬。\n更看宵景好，新月起高雯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32122,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惠麓晚归","author":"顾敩愉","text":"闲云三两岫，深处是山家。\n幽径无来客，轻风扫落花。\n溪光空翠合，树影夕阳斜。\n回指旧游处，苍苍横暮霞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32123,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初晴","author":"顾敩愉","text":"春日暖晖晖，春烟媚翠微。\n风轻花自落，树静鸟忘飞。\n危石垂云发，浮萍绣水衣。\n闲居绝尘事，望远倚荆扉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32124,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬夜","author":"顾敩愉","text":"苦露夜冥冥，林空石气清。\n断云涵落叶，古涧泻寒星。\n荒草无幽径，衰兰委远汀。\n狂吟愁独返，徙倚短长亭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32125,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏偶成","author":"顾飏宪","text":"余花数片入帘帏，庭院愔愔履迹稀。\n竹桁昼闲鸣翡翠，暖风晴日浣春衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32126,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻学和仲兄殁于伏羌不得消息","author":"顾飏宪","text":"传闻偏不误，肠断脊令原。\n正是情怀恶，那堪风雨昏。\n连宵惊人梦，何日返羁魂。\n天意殊茫昧，凭谁对榻论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32127,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和响泉叔父九月七日游惠山韵二首 其一","author":"顾飏宪","text":"纵目清秋宇宙宽，五湖浩荡一渔竿。\n胜游到处疑飞屐，新句拈来似弹丸。\n吴岫云停看尺咫，蜀山翠扫忆千盘。\n如今好作林泉主，茶雨松风草阁寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32128,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和响泉叔父九月七日游惠山韵二首 其二","author":"顾飏宪","text":"岩菊斑斑嫩蕊香，轻霜着树杂青黄。\n三秋节未逢重九，七日辰先遇少阳。\n石蹬有情留点笔，碧山无语对飞觞。\n微酲初解新茶熟，一勺清甘自在尝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32129,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"穹庐山中望晴","author":"高拱枢","text":"登眺为逃秦，偏余惯惜春。\n风高通雨气，云薄透山身。\n鸟接探梅客，天容着屐人。\n禅房花径古，野语隐盟真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32130,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"观莳","author":"高世观","text":"男妇呼深树，盘餐聚一村。\n蝇蚊庭草湿，星月路泥浑。\n晚斋犹占雨，人眠不待昏。\n还期集余力，苗影接山根。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32131,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次内侄顾山公韵","author":"高莲生","text":"潜确还吾素，栖迟一草庐。\n闲来怀往事，睡起读残书。\n性岂因人热，形宜与世疏。\n芙蓉江上望，秋老更何如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32132,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"止水祠","author":"高莲生","text":"谁来池上问源头，藻荇风牵水镜流。\n得共传薪扶绝业，似同立雪补从游。\n国门声价瞻山斗，嵩室襟期寄壑邱。\n卖却船归官若水，诗成浩气欲横秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32133,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓行","author":"高龄","text":"旅舍寒衾拥寂寥，无端一梦到渔樵。\n醒来仍是风尘客，残月清霜过野桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32134,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"败蕉","author":"高龄","text":"画图曾见雪中蕉，何事秋深尔便凋。\n应与愁人同一处，隔窗频度可怜宵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32135,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重九前一日江头夜泊","author":"高龄","text":"萧散楼船客，烟波送夕曛。\n江声喧静夜，旅况冷孤云。\n好句愁中得，疏钟梦后闻。\n龙山朝可望，吾独愧参军。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32136,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寻碧山吟社遗址怀兴复诸先生","author":"龚南标","text":"兴废非偶然，当年事犹昨。\n只今久沦灭，屈指频惊愕。\n废池春草封，古蔓残碑络。\n青山独无恙，空翠向人落。\n我欲共素心，卜此山居乐。\n回念山中人，高风久不作。\n俯仰竟茫茫，斜阳没村郭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32137,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石浪庵山楼社集分体分韵得七律青字","author":"龚南标","text":"值杖层波挂酒瓶，春风良会屐初停。\n楼高百尺虚窗白，浪涌千重列岫青。\n闲就客吟泉上石，话同僧过竹边亭。\n醉于马上乘船过，松外春涛万古醒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32138,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日早渡柳园口","author":"龚桐","text":"水浅流还急，寒轻冻未凝。\n树迷三里雾，澌走一河冰。\n断岸心多怯，中流感忽增。\n何时春涨发，破浪借风乘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32139,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古道","author":"龚桐","text":"古道列桑麻，槎枒老树斜。\n居人原土著，游子自天涯。\n石屋山神庙，花墙戍卒家。\n驱车看落日，林杪散烟霞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32140,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游平山堂同华师道作","author":"龚锡纯","text":"漫将仪礼质欧阳，稽首文章太守堂。\n门下曾苏开北宋，眼前桃李属东皇。\n卷帘山色江南好，刻竹歌声阁外长。\n只有醉翁能独醒，后生何处问津梁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32141,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二泉书院","author":"龚锡纯","text":"江陵于分宜，相去一问耳。\n分宜无不至，江陵亦诚鄙。\n但看郑乡校，书院曷可毁。\n毁之甚防川，天下纷然矣。\n朝野乃相持，岂复有国是。\n岿然鲁灵光，二泉九龙峙。\n文庄去已久，并移忠定祀。\n固赖贤守令，虚堂亦可委。\n清风吹竹林，清泉流不已。\n在下师文庄，在上侨可企。\n不闻古大臣，休休无他技。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":32142,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]